    <abstract pn="section-abstract">
      <t indent="0" pn="section-abstract-1">IANA defined the &quot;OTN Signal Type&quot; subregistry of the &quot;Generalized
Multi-Protocol Label Switching (GMPLS) Signaling Parameters&quot; registry
in RFC 7139.  This document updates the &quot;OTN Signal Type&quot; subregistry
to allow registration via Specification Required.</t>
    </abstract>
